<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Create lightweight, fast to draw and fire weapons.-->
  <VWE_Quickdraw.description>解锁制作轻量级的枪械，能快速拔出并开火。</VWE_Quickdraw.description>
  <VWE_Quickdraw.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->the edge of speed-->
    <li>subject-&gt;极致速度</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the art of weapon design for speed, crafting firearms that are as swift to engage as they are lethal-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了注重速度的武器设计技艺，制造迅猛且致命的武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered mechanisms that minimize draw time, ensuring that readiness and rapid response define every encounter-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计了可以尽可能减少拔枪时间的机械结构，以确保能在每次冲突时准备就绪和快速反应</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->shaping the future of combat with the quicksilver grace of rapid deployment-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;以快速部署的优雅塑造战斗的未来</li>
  </VWE_Quickdraw.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: quick draw-->
  <VWE_Quickdraw.label>快速拔枪</VWE_Quickdraw.label>
